"""Sparse lexical cues, with a separate document-opening baseline.

Positive cues include assistant-role headers, noun uses of 'means' and
'cause', and Chinese dictionary senses of meaning and causation. Negative
cues include locally negated 'even'/'exactly', Chinese calling/naming
verbs, two degree expressions, and the bare stems 活 and 招. Formatting
rules cover chat markers, title metadata, PHP and HTML openers, and
initial articles, dependency declarations, indentation and word shape.

