Chinese deputy, burden/negative and wealth spellings give the largest negative
values. Attachment, width, assignment and selected short compounds are weaker.
Korean bu is strongest at word beginnings; Fu, Vietnamese phu and English full
also respond. Adjacent characters disambiguate a few compounds. Traditional
